    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Willow is an exceptional A2-rated, four-bedroom detached family home extending to 139 sq. m. (1,496 sq. ft.), thoughtfully designed to deliver the perfect balance of style, comfort, and energy efficiency. Offering bright, spacious accommodation throughout, this beautifully crafted home has been designed with modern family living in mind, combining contemporary architecture with a practical and versatile layout.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the impressive open-plan kitchen, dining, and family area, creating a light-filled space ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. A separate utility room provides added convenience, while the elegant front living room offers a comfortable retreat. A guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the generous accommodation comprises four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious principal suite with a private en-suite, alongside a beautifully appointed family bathroom and additional storage.\r\n\r\nWith its excellent energy performance, quality finishes, and thoughtfully designed layout, The Willow offers an outstanding opportunity to enjoy contemporary family living in a home built to the highest standards.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\nA2 BER energy-rated home\r\nFour-bedroom detached family residence\r\n139 sq.m. / 1,496 sq.ft.\r\nBright open-plan kitchen, dining & family area\r\nSpacious front living room\r\nPrincipal bedroom with en-suite\r\nThree additional generously proportioned bedrooms\r\nContemporary family bathroom\r\nSeparate utility room\r\nGuest WC\r\nExcellent storage throughout\r\nEnergy-efficient construction with high levels of insulation\r\nLarge windows maximising natural light\r\nModern specification and high-quality finishes throughout\r\n\r\nThis exceptional detached home has been thoughtfully designed to meet the demands of modern family life, offering spacious accommodation, outstanding energy efficiency, and timeless style in equal measure.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Savills New Homes on (01) 618 1300."
      },
